          "unit_order": 20,
          "source_marker": "16",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Jam&chapter=4&verse=16"
          ],
          "text": "ወይእዜሰ፡ ትትሜክሑ፡ በምግባሪክሙ። ወኵላ፡ ትምክሕት፡ እንተ፡ ከመ፡ ዝ፡ እኪት፡ ይእቲ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 21,
          "unit_order": 21,
          "source_marker": "17",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Jam&chapter=4&verse=17"
          ],
          "text": "ወዘየአምር፡ ገቢሮታ፡ ለሠናይት፡ ወኢይገብራ፡ ኀጢአተ፡ ትከውኖ።"
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 5,
