          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Jam&chapter=5&verse=1"
          ],
          "text": "ንዑ፡ ይእዜኒ፡ አብዕልት፡ ወብክዩ። እንዘ፡ ትግዕሩ፡ ላዕለ፡ ሕርትምናክሙ፡ እንተ፡ ሀለዋ፡ ትምጻእክሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 3,
          "unit_order": 3,
          "source_marker": "2",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Jam&chapter=5&verse=2"
          ],
          "text": "ብዕልክሙኒ፡ ነቅዘ፡ ወአልባሲክሙኒ፡ ቈንቈነ።"
        },
        {
