          "unit_order": 6,
          "source_marker": "5",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Jam&chapter=5&verse=5"
          ],
          "text": "ወፈጋዕክሙ፡ ላዕለ፡ ምድር፡ ወአስተትክሙ፡ ወተደለውክሙ፡ ወአሥባሕክሙ፡ ልበክሙ። ከመ፡ ዘያሥብሕ፡ ላሕመ፡ ለዕለተ፡ ጥብሐት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 7,
          "unit_order": 7,
          "source_marker": "6",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Jam&chapter=5&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "ወተዐደውክሙ፡ ወቀተልክምዎ፡ ለጻድቅ፡ ዘእንበለ፡ ይትቃወመክሙ፡ ወኦሆ፡ ይብለክሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 8,
          "unit_order": 8,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ትዕግሥት፡ ብፅዕት"
        },
        {
          "number": 9,
