          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Jam&chapter=5&verse=8"
          ],
          "text": "ተዐገሡኬ፡ አንትሙ፡ ወአጽንዑ፡ ልበክሙ። እስመ፡ ቀርበ፡ ምጽአቱ፡ ለእግዚእክሙ።"
        },
